377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 152 0 R
/E (In the bedrooms, patterned terracotta tile floors replace carpet, instantly adding texture and personality. The primary bedroom feels  balanced and calm, like its own private spa retreat. Fully painted sage green walls, plush cream bedding, and warm finishes create a sense of serenity and ease. The space is elevated with luxury amenities, including a kitchenette and private fireplace, a queen sleeper sofa, and a spa-like bathroom with a soaking tub, double vanity, and walk-in closet.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
