/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (Where the kitchen is the social heart of Terra Luz, the pool and patio will remain the eye candy of this home through its aesthetics; but, the simple pleasures of water submerged loungers under the brella, meditative pebble garden and terracotta stone fire pit feel amplified here, perfect for quiet indulgence or social media-worthy moments.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (Evenings flow effortlessly: guests gather around the firepit-turned-coffee-table for casual meals, grilled  dinners, or order-in from local favorites like Desert Beer pizza. Movie nights take on a new magic with the inflatable screen and a curated watchlist with nods to world travel like Casablanca or Buena Vista Social Club; rom coms like Palm Springs with Andy Samberg; family flicks like Moana, Coco and Encanto.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
